```

## Run

```
uv run flask --app src/{{ package_name }}/main.py run
```
{% if migrations and orm == "flask-sqlalchemy" %}
Apply migrations first: `uv run flask --app src/{{ package_name }}/main.py db upgrade`.
{% elif migrations and orm == "sqlalchemy" %}
Apply migrations first: `uv run alembic upgrade head`.
{% endif %}
